22861", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831580_872153135156194_5876685621274680969_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xxXjbR79GS0Q7kNvwEzSbjp&_nc_oc=AdpsXNf-IhfyODVXl-jii5SrKG9yWlQhhNbTlu1eghCLDSQ7C6sjubPWJXiZcUwyb-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJSgeCc29CS23eUT-_Wz9p0xo0RxhEAFGpH1-rnECW-jg&oe=6A9C34AC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "4164431357163434", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308575_4164431360496767_6537726024098852990_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DId5HpaAV88Q7kNvwHs0Z5T&_nc_oc=Adr1qAFsXX6rjD4-h0d7fUtJ33b5p9KS358UvfpkuNQ6TSmtC_fHnICTHwWRAuZVP1U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLnZHwhvZRpkbUCLReISORHvvxo2SCdgrehV03XP2XAKw&oe=6A9C2A1B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Monke Mages", "keywords": ["Magic", "Spells", "Monkey", "Pvp", "Multiplayer"], "long_description": "**Cast spells with thy voice and become the ultimate Monke Mage \u2014 FREE to play! \ud83d\udc12\ud83d\udd2e**\n\nDoth thou wish to be magick? Art thou a monke? Then thy destiny awaiteth!\n\nMonke Mages is a FREE multiplayer VR spell-casting battle game where thy voice is thy weapon. Speak the ancient words, raise thy wand, and unleash chaos upon thy fellow monkes in a frantic PvP and PvE arena. No buttons. No gestures. Just thy voice and thy will.\n\n# \ud83d\udd2e What Canst Thou Do?\n\n- **Turn thy friends into a frog** \u2014 ribbit, fool\n- **Suck thine enemies into a twirly whirly** \u2014 spinning is not winning\n- **Light thy friends on fire** \u2014 Extra Crispy is a perfectly valid strategy\n- **Unleash a Death Wave** upon all who oppose thee\n- **Wield Unlimited Power** \u2014 the name speaks for itself\n- **Then laugh** as thy friends perish at thy feet\n\nAll with nothing but thy voice and thy magic wand.\n\n# \u2694\ufe0f The Arena Awaits\n\nDrop into the Magic Arena and face thy fellow monkes in chaotic PvP combat \u2014 or summon PvE enemies that will crush thee with a somewhat large hammer or bite thee many times without reproach.\n\n**Unlock new Mage Ranks by slaying other monkes. Can thou become a Grand Master?**\n\n# \ud83d\udcdc The Grimoire\n\n- **5 free spells** to master from the moment thou doth install\n- **1 free map** to begin thy arcane journey\n- **Unlock all 12 spells and the full Magic Arena** for but a single dollar \ud83d\udcb0\n\nOne dollar. Twelve spells. Unlimited monke carnage.\n\n# Doth Thou Have What It Taketh? \ud83d\udc12\ud83d\udd2e", "short_description": "Speak the ancient words, raise thy wand, and destroy thy friends \u2014 FREE to play! \ud83d\udc12\ud83d\udd2e"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/monkemages/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Red Team Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "27100255156253407"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822581_4284124781806019_5481497302197202891_n.png?stp=ds